{"id": 14250, "title": "Shopping", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "shopping-story", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14250_shopping-story.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：先生，你想买什么？", "B：我很渴，有喝的东西吗？", "A：有。我们有水、茶、牛奶、咖啡、啤酒，你想喝什么？", "B：我要一瓶啤酒。", "A：好的，还要什么吗？", "B：我也买些吃的东西吧。", "A：没问题。我们有米饭、面条，也有面包，你想要哪个？", "B：一个面包。一共多少钱？", "A：啤酒三块五，面包十块，一共十三块五。", "B：好的，给你钱。", "A：这是你买的东西，再见。", "B：再见。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：先生，你想買什麼？", "B：我很渴，有喝的東西嗎？", "A：有。我們有水、茶、牛奶、咖啡、啤酒，你想喝什麼？", "B：我要一瓶啤酒。", "A：好的，還要什麼嗎？", "B：我也買些吃的東西吧。", "A：沒問題。我們有米飯、麵條，也有麵包，你想要哪個？", "B：一個麵包。一共多少錢？", "A：啤酒三塊五，麵包十塊，一共十三塊五。", "B：好的，給你錢。", "A：這是你買的東西，再見。", "B：再見。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： xiān sheng， nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me？", "B： wǒ hěn kě， yǒu hē de dōng xi ma？", "A： yǒu。 wǒ men yǒu shuǐ、 chá、 niú nǎi、 kā fēi、 pí jiǔ， nǐ xiǎng hē shén me？", "B： wǒ yào yī píng pí jiǔ。", "A： hǎo de， hái yào shén me ma？", "B： wǒ yě mǎi xiē chī de dōng xi ba。", "A： méi wèn tí。 wǒ men yǒu mǐ fàn、 miàn tiáo， yě yǒu miàn bāo， nǐ xiǎng yào něi gè？", "B： yī gè miàn bāo。 yī gòng duō shao qián？", "A： pí jiǔ sān kuài wǔ， miàn bāo shí kuài， yī gòng shí sān kuài wǔ。", "B： hǎo de， gěi nǐ qián。", "A： zhè shì nǐ mǎi de dōng xi， zài jiàn。", "B： zài jiàn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: Sir, what do you want to buy?", "B: I'm very thirsty. Is there anything to drink?", "A: Yes. We have water, tea, milk, coffee, beer. What would you like to drink?", "B: I want a bottle of beer.", "A: Okay, anything else?", "B: Let me buy some food too.", "A: No problem. We have rice, noodles, and bread. Which one do you want?", "B: A piece of bread. How much is the total?", "A: Three and a half dollars for beer and ten dollars for bread, a total of thirteen and a half dollars.", "", "A: This is what you bought. Goodbye.", "B: Goodbye."], "english_full": "A: Sir, what do you want to buy?\n\nB: I'm very thirsty. Is there anything to drink?\n\nA: Yes. We have water, tea, milk, coffee, beer. What would you like to drink?\n\nB: I want a bottle of beer.\n\nA: Okay, anything else?\n\nB: Let me buy some food too.\n\nA: No problem. We have rice, noodles, and bread. Which one do you want?\n\nB: A piece of bread. How much is the total?\n\nA: Three and a half dollars for beer and ten dollars for bread, a total of thirteen and a half dollars.\n\n\n\nA: This is what you bought. Goodbye.\n\nB: Goodbye.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiān sheng\" data-defn=\"teacher / gentleman; sir; mister (Mr.) / husband / (dialect) doctor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">先生</span><span class=\"tr\">先生</span><rt>xiān sheng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mǎi\" data-defn=\"to buy / to purchase\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shén me\" data-defn=\"what?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麼</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kě\" data-defn=\"thirsty\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">渴</span><span class=\"tr\